{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026BX8KeBcJJ71792969763.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國佛羅里達州發生槍擊案，最少12人受傷，包括6名小童。暫時未有人被捕。</p><p></p><p>槍擊案發生在周六晚佛羅里達州塔拉哈西一個欖球場附近。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.SHOOTING-0300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264glyJF8ZbK1792969760.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>當地警方表示事發時球賽剛結束，人潮擠擁。初步調查顯示，槍擊前有兩三人打鬥。傷者中有11人被槍傷，1人走避時受傷。到周日早上有5名傷者已出院，仍然留醫傷者中，1人情況危殆。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:39.826903+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T23:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:25.541929+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:25.541929+00:00","content_hash":"2d8de447874d095570764ed25326408a40eb4d895916692ac0603b0d91b90f7d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}